    skos:closeMatch <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300012869>, <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300343502> ;
    skos:definition "a general trade name for several descriptions of clear soluble gums. The best, or true white gum, is yielded by *Acacia verec* of Guilenin, the red gum arabic by *A. Adansonii*: *A. vera* also yields gum arabic and a part of the senegal gum. Our imports of gum arabic are about 3000 tons a year. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 195]"@en ;
